{"id":"ensayo","lemma":"ensayo","pos":"noun","rank":2061,"glosses":["essay; paper; nonfiction (in genre-labeling contexts)","test/testing, trial, experiment","try, attempt, assay"],"ipa":"/enˈsaʝo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"ensayos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c2/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-ensayo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Escribe un ensayo corto.","en":"Write a short essay.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453404","words":[{"g":"to write","l":"escribir"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"short"}]},{"text":"Puedes terminar tu ensayo ahora.","en":"You can finish your essay now.","words":[{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to finish"},{"g":"your"},null,{"g":"now"}]},{"text":"Hoy es el ensayo general.","en":"Today is the dress rehearsal.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/508471","words":[{"g":"today, tonight"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"general, overall"}]},{"text":"Tendré que realizar algunos ensayos más.","en":"I'll need to run some more tests.","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to carry out"},{"g":"someone","l":"alguno"},null,{"g":"more"}]},{"text":"Ella pasó mucho tiempo escribiendo su ensayo.","en":"She spent a lot of time writing her essay.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/608728","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to pass","l":"pasar"},{"g":"much"},{"g":"time"},{"g":"to write","l":"escribir"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]}]}